    "enUS": {
      "description": "As you regain your composure and focus your gaze, you notice that something stirs within the crystal. Upon closer inspection, you realize that you are looking into the past... a memory... long forgotten.",
      "eventObjectiveLabel": "The War of the Shifting Sands",
      "summary": "Learn all that you can of the past, then speak with Anachronos at the Caverns of Time in Tanaris.\n",
      "title": "A Pawn on the Eternal Board",
